<title>USA: MarkWest Hydrocarbon Q1 shr rises.</title>
<headline>MarkWest Hydrocarbon Q1 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>MarkWest Hydrocarbon, Inc.</p>
<p>	     (Dollars in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						   March 31,</p>
<p>					    1997	1996(A)  % Change</p>
<p> Revenues				  $28,704     $19,860    45%</p>
<p> Net income before taxes		 6,918	 4,173    66%</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes	    2,636	 1,586    66%</p>
<p> Net income				  4,282	 2,587    66%</p>
<p> Earnings per share			 0.50	  0.33    52%</p>
<p> Average shares			    8,485	 7,908     7%</p>
<p>NOTE (A): 1996 data is pro forma for provision for income taxes, net income, earnings per share and weighted average shares outstanding. Before a reorganization in October 1996 in preparation for the company's initial public offering, MarkWest was organized as a partnership and was therefor not subject to income tax.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
